== another template
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: no job runs a recognized vulnerability scanner (govulncheck, pip-audit, pnpm audit, npm audit, osv-scanner or trivy), and the pipeline includes neither GitLab's Dependency-Scanning template nor its dependency-scanning component
fix: add a job whose script runs the scanner for the component's language, such as govulncheck ./... for Go, pip-audit for Python or pnpm audit for TypeScript, or include the dependency-scanning CI/CD component pinned to a commit SHA

